      (type dash))
    (fill
      (type none))
    (uuid "5a8a5b92-c9fa-5f89-a1d0-76e041a7bf16"))
  (text "Cathode switches (MMBTA42, shared by all tubes)"
    (at 21.27 221.27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "c6bf782e-eeef-57be-9a2b-31ed6aad0bf3"))
  (rectangle
    (start 410 25)
    (end 575 140)
    (stroke
      (width 0.15)
      (type dash))
    (fill
      (type none))
    (uuid "8b3f5505-1522-5d88-b4de-1d594b704d91"))
  (text "Colon neons (SEC_0 upper / SEC_1 lower)"
    (at 411.27 26.27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "51b23fe8-09ec-5b3e-9cd2-e950675d7836"))
  (text "Both colon positions in parallel: SEC_0 = upper dots, SEC_1 = lower dots.\nFirmware drives SEC_0/SEC_1 independently. 150k per neon: ~0.6 mA at 170 V."
    (at 415 125 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "fa1003f7-e2f6-5fb6-bc45-328b0a0972b7"))
  (rectangle
    (start 410 150)
    (end 575 300)
    (stroke
      (width 0.15)
      (type dash))
    (fill
      (type none))
    (uuid "a76e4989-9250-5537-a43f-0093799635a5"))
  (text "Off-cathode clamp (anti-ghosting, as PCB-036)"
    (at 411.27 151.27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "410616dd-5a40-57fd-8ee1-7d4a28473211"))
  (text "KBIAS = 170 V x 100k/530k = ~32 V. Off cathodes are held at or below it,\nso the lit anode cannot glow them and the MMBTA42s stay well under VCEO."
    (at 415 280 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "1bd197b3-012b-5151-98ff-3c50030de7c0"))
